{"sha": "c0ca301636eafbf59057cd882aa5ae1625d2a887f92e64c3ff87716deef00c45", "body": ["\\section*{第 \\ref{ch:g12:light-as-wave} 章 --- 光的波动性：衍射与干涉}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:light-as-wave:1}", "$f = c/\\lambda$：红光 $\\num{3.00e8}/\\num{7.0e-7} \\approx", "\\qty{4.3e14}{Hz}$；紫光 $\\approx \\qty{7.5e14}{Hz}$ --- 紫光", "频率更高（波长更短，速率同为 $c$）。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:light-as-wave:2}", "$\\theta = \\num{5.32e-7}/\\num{2.0e-4} = \\qty{2.7e-3}{rad}$;", "$L = 2\\theta D = 2 \\times \\num{2.66e-3} \\times 1.5 \\approx", "\\qty{8.0}{mm}$.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:light-as-wave:3}", "声音：$\\lambda = 340/425 = \\qty{0.80}{m}$，则 $\\lambda/a = 1.0$ ---", "衍射最强，声音充满走廊。光：", "$\\lambda/a \\approx \\num{5.5e-7}/0.80 \\approx \\num{7e-7}$ ---", "扩散可忽略不计：光沿直线传播，拐角即可将其挡住。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:light-as-wave:4}", "在 $M$ 处：$\\delta = \\qty{6.0}{cm} = 3\\lambda$，相长干涉 --- 明亮。", "在 $N$ 处：$\\delta = \\qty{5.0}{cm} = (2 + \\tfrac12)\\lambda$，相消", "--- （近乎）暗。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:light-as-wave:5}", "$i = \\lambda D/a = \\num{6.33e-7} \\times 1.8/\\num{2.5e-4} \\approx", "\\qty{4.6}{mm}$。在 $\\pm\\qty{1.0}{cm}$ 之内：$|k| \\leq 10/4.6 = 2.2$，", "则 $k = -2, \\dots, 2$：共五条亮条纹。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:light-as-wave:6}", "$d = 2\\lambda D/L = 2 \\times \\num{6.5e-7} \\times 1.6/0.028 \\approx", "\\qty{74}{\\micro m}$.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:light-as-wave:7}", "$i = \\qty{4.7}{mm}$，则 $\\lambda = i\\,a/D = \\num{4.7e-3} \\times", "\\num{2.0e-4}/1.5 \\approx \\qty{6.3e-7}{m} = \\qty{630}{nm}$：红光。", "测量十个条纹间距，可使刻度尺的读数误差降为原来的十分之一。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:light-as-wave:8}", "两盏灯的频率（大致）相同，但 \\emph{不", "同步}：每盏灯发出一段段短促的波列，相位随机跳变，因此", "两光源不相干，瞬时条纹", "每秒移动数十亿次 --- 人眼看到的只是平均效果：均匀一片。", "杨用 \\emph{同一}列波照亮两条缝：两束光", "每次相位跳变都一同继承，故始终保持同步。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:light-as-wave:9}", "第一条至第七条亮纹之间的距离 $= 6i = \\qty{18.0}{mm}$，则 $i = \\qty{3.0}{mm}$；", "$\\lambda = i\\,a/D = \\num{3.0e-3} \\times \\num{3.0e-4}/1.4 \\approx", "\\qty{6.4e-7}{m} \\approx \\qty{640}{nm}$.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:light-as-wave:10}", "$\\sin\\theta = k\\lambda/d = 0.396\\,k$: $k = 1$, $\\theta = 23^\\circ$;", "$k = 2$，$\\sin\\theta = 0.79$，$\\theta = 52^\\circ$；$k = 3$ 时需要", "$\\sin\\theta = 1.19 > 1$：不可能。最高级次 $k = 2$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:light-as-wave:11}", "$\\theta = \\num{5.5e-7}/0.10 = \\qty{5.5e-6}{rad}$。两盏车灯", "所张角为 $1.5/\\num{1.0e5} = \\qty{1.5e-5}{rad}$，约为", "衍射模糊角的三倍：能分辨，刚好。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:light-as-wave:12}", "前、后表面的反射光发生干涉；白光下，每种厚度", "使部分波长相长、部分波长相消，因而呈现一种", "颜色。薄膜厚度只与高度有关，因此等色点", "构成水平条带。排液使薄膜变薄，因此", "产生某一颜色的薄膜厚度位置越来越低：", "条带缓慢下移。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:light-as-wave:13}", "$i = \\lambda D/a$：紫光 $\\num{4.0e-7} \\times 1.5/\\num{2.0e-4} =", "\\qty{3.0}{mm}$；红光 $\\qty{5.6}{mm}$。中央：各色均亮 ---", "形成一条白色条纹。离中央数毫米处，各色条纹", "已彼此错开：呈现虹彩条纹。", "更远处，各色亮纹处处重叠，呈均匀的白色模糊。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:light-as-wave:14}", "$\\theta = \\num{5.5e-7}/2.4 = \\qty{2.3e-7}{rad}$；在 \\qty{250}{km}", "处，即 $\\num{2.3e-7} \\times \\num{2.5e5} \\approx \\qty{6}{cm}$。它能", "数清汽车、发现行人，但报纸的字（毫米大小的字母）", "比衍射极限小二十倍：此说法纯属谣传。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:light-as-wave:15}", "频率由光源决定，保持不变。速率降为", "$c/n$，故 $\\lambda' = \\lambda/n$，且", "$i' = i/n = 4.0/1.33 \\approx \\qty{3.0}{mm}$：条纹变密。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{pb:g12:light-as-wave:1}", "\\textbf{1.} $\\theta = \\lambda/a = \\num{6.33e-7}/\\num{1.00e-4} =", "\\qty{6.3e-3}{rad}$.", "", "\\textbf{2.} 半宽 $D\\tan\\theta \\approx D\\theta = \\lambda D/a$，", "则 $L = 2\\lambda D/a = 2 \\times \\num{6.33e-7} \\times", "3.00/\\num{1.00e-4} = \\qty{3.8}{cm}$.", "", "\\textbf{3.} $(3.8 - 3.7)/3.8 \\approx 3\\%$：在刻度尺的", "精度之内 --- 已验证。", ""]}